%I A399772 #6 Sep 18 2026 00:00:15
%S A399772 1,0,0,0,0,240,0,10080,0,43182720,0,3597501600,0
%N A399772 Number of labeled directed strongly regular graphs on n vertices.
%C A399772 Also, a(15) = 3218491743667200. Although the directed strongly regular graphs on 14 and 15 vertices have both been completely classified up to isomorphism, the published classification for n = 14 does not give the automorphism-group orders needed to determine the labeled count a(14), whereas these data are available for n = 15.
%H A399772 A. E. Brouwer, <a href="https://homepages.cwi.nl/~aeb/math/dsrg/dsrg.html">Parameters of directed strongly regular graphs</a>.
%H A399772 L. K. Jørgensen, <a href="https://vbn.aau.dk/en/publications/search-for-directed-strongly-regular-graphs">Search for directed strongly regular graphs</a>, Research Report Series R-99-2016, Aalborg University (1999).
%F A399772 a(n) = Sum_{[G]} n!/|Aut(G)|, where the sum is over all isomorphism classes of directed strongly regular graphs on n vertices.
%e A399772 For n = 6, there is one graph in each of two complementary parameter classes, each having automorphism group of order 6; hence a(6) = 2*6!/6 = 240.
%Y A399772 Cf. A399766, A076435, A088741.
%K A399772 nonn,more,new
%O A399772 1,6
%A A399772 _Vladeta Jovovic_, Sep 10 2026
